{"blocks":[["Ableton/File/","source-block-948","Archive formats (packs) should be treated as immutable binaries.",["Ableton File Types – Conceptual Overview","Key Principles"]],["Ableton/File/","source-block-1021","Programmatically generated files (e.g., .asd) should be excluded since Live will recreate them.",["Ableton File Types – Conceptual Overview","Key Principles"]],["Ableton/File/","source-block-1127","File Types & Internal Structure",["Ableton File Types – Conceptual Overview"]],["Ableton/File/","source-block-1526","Misconceptions",["Ableton File Types – Conceptual Overview"]],["Ableton/File/","source-block-1547","Myth: All Ableton files are binary and unsuitable for Git.",["Ableton File Types – Conceptual Overview","Misconceptions"]],["Ableton/File/","source-block-1705","Myth: .asd files must be backed up.",["Ableton File Types – Conceptual Overview","Misconceptions"]],["Ableton/File/","source-block-1837","Recommendations for Git",["Ableton File Types – Conceptual Overview"]],["Ableton/File/","source-block-1867","Store with filters: .als, .alc, .adg, .adv, .amxd, .ask.",["Ableton File Types – Conceptual Overview","Recommendations for Git"]],["Ableton/File/","source-block-1944","Ignore: .asd (auto-regenerated).",["Ableton File Types – Conceptual Overview","Recommendations for Git"]],["Ableton/File/","source-block-1987","Store as binary: .alp, .ams, .agr (no useful diffs).",["Ableton File Types – Conceptual Overview","Recommendations for Git"]],["Ableton/File/","source-block-2054","Use custom diff drivers:",["Ableton File Types – Conceptual Overview","Recommendations for Git"]],["Ableton/File/","source-block-2087",".als/.alc/.adg/.adv: gzip -cd.",["Ableton File Types – Conceptual Overview","Recommendations for Git","Use custom diff drivers:"]],["Ableton/File/","source-block-2133",".amxd: strip header, parse JSON.",["Ableton File Types – Conceptual Overview","Recommendations for Git","Use custom diff drivers:"]],["Ableton/File/","source-block-2173",".ask: plain XML diff.",["Ableton File Types – Conceptual Overview","Recommendations for Git","Use custom diff drivers:"]],["Ableton/File/","source-block-2202","See Also",["Ableton File Types – Conceptual Overview"]],["Ableton/File/","source-block-2217","Person/Zack Steinkamp/blog/posts/2022-02-15-git-diff-amxd-max",["Ableton File Types – Conceptual Overview","See Also"]],["Ableton/File/","source-block-2287","GitHub/codekiln/ableton-live-git-hooks",["Ableton File Types – Conceptual Overview","See Also"]],["Ableton/File/.adg/","source-block-31","Purpose: Device Group (Rack preset).",[]],["Ableton/File/.adg/","source-block-74","Format: gzipped XML.",[]],["Ableton/File/.adg/","source-block-101","Git: Store; use gzip -cd filter for text diffs.",[]],["Ableton/File/.adv/","source-block-31","Purpose: Device Preset (single Instrument/Effect preset).",[]],["Ableton/File/.adv/","source-block-95","Format: likely gzipped XML (similar to .adg).",[]],["Ableton/File/.adv/","source-block-149","Git: Store; verify format. Use same filter strategy as .adg.",[]],["Ableton/File/.agr/","source-block-31","Purpose: Groove File (timing/humanization template).",[]],["Ableton/File/.agr/","source-block-90","Format: binary.",[]],["Ableton/File/.agr/","source-block-112","Git: Store if custom grooves are central to project; diffs not possible.",[]]],"format_version":5}